abstract: >-
  Blind reference-differential binding oracle for Linux livepatch modules.
  Version v2.1 is the census oracle and v2.0 the held-out oracle. Earlier
  frozen versions are kept for the scores that used them. The archive also holds the immediate check, the fault
  operators, the selection and build scripts for a corpus of 150 CVE fixes on
  stable kernels, the loader, presence-test and generator-comparison runners,
  and every run record behind the reported results, including the held-out draw and the census of Amazon Linux 2023
  livepatch packages.
keywords:
